{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:20585-1","published":"2026-02-20T15:41:52Z","modified":"2026-03-23T04:53:03.652836Z","summary":"Security update for docker-stable","details":"This update for docker-stable fixes the following issues:\n\n- Enable SELinux in default daemon.json config (--selinux-enabled).\n  This has no practical impact on non-SELinux systems (bsc#1252290).\n- Remove git-core recommends on SLE. Most SLE systems have installRecommends=yes\n  by default and thus end up installing git with Docker (bsc#1250508).\n- Include historical changelog data from before the docker-stable fork.\n  This includes CVE numbers for security tracking reasons (bsc#1250596).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"docker-stable","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/docker-stable&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"docker-stable":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-bash-completion":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-buildx":"0.25.0-160000.3.1","docker-stable-fish-completion":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-rootless-extras":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-zsh-completion":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:20585-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"docker-stable","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server for SAP applications 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/docker-stable&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%20for%20SAP%20applications%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"docker-stable":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-bash-completion":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-buildx":"0.25.0-160000.3.1","docker-stable-fish-completion":"24.0.9_ce-160000.3.1","docker-stable-rootless-extras":"24.0.9_ce-160000